t placeholder that randomly inserts one entry from a predefined list, adding variety and reducing prompt repetition.\n\nTo use a Wildcard, create a .txt file inside the wildcards folder of the Impact Pack (custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/wildcards). Each line in the file represents a different prompt entry.\n\nWrite your prompt in the first text box and insert Wildcards wherever desired. Each Wildcard will be replaced with a randomly selected entry from its corresponding .txt file.\n\nLeave the Wildcard field empty and write the prompt normally if you don't want to use Wildcards.\n\n### Tips\n\nTo generate different Wildcard combinations, keep Batch Size = 1 and increase the Batch Count/Queue Count instead. Each new execution re-rolls the Wildcards, while Batch Size usually reuses the same resolved prompt for every image in the batch."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### Important\nThe Style & Prompt Encoder (\"Positive\") node already contains advanced built-in prompt presets. If you choose to use one of these presets, it might change some aspects of the chosen Wildcard, keep that in mind.\n\n### ImpactWildcardEncode\nWildcard is a reusable text placeholder that randomly inserts one entry from a predefined list, adding variety and reducing prompt repetition.\n\nTo use a Wildcard, create a .txt file inside the wildcards folder of the Impact Pack (custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/wildcards). Each line in the file represents a different prompt entry.\n\nWrite your prompt in the first text box and insert Wildcards wherever desired. Each Wildcard will be replaced with a randomly selected entry from its corresponding .txt file.\n\nLeave the Wildcard field empty and write the prompt normally if you don't want to use Wildcards.\n\n### Tips\n\nTo generate different Wildcard combinations, keep Batch Size = 1 and increase the Batch Count/Queue Count instead. Each new execution re-rolls the Wildcards, while Batch Size usually reuses the same resolved prompt for every image in the batch."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[6,20,0,2,3,"FLOAT"],[12,10,0,12,1,"VAE"],[13,12,0,14,0,"IMAGE"],[14,13,0,14,1,"INT"],[15,22,0,14,2,"*"],[16,11,0,14,3,"STRING"],[17,14,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[25,20,0,21,0,"FLOAT"],[26,21,0,22,0,"FLOAT"],[27,24,0,25,2,"CONDITIONING"],[32,25,0,12,0,"LATENT"],[35,27,0,25,0,"LATENT"],[37,28,0,29,0,"MODEL"],[38,29,0,25,1,"MODEL"],[45,17,0,32,0,"LATENT"],[46,32,0,27,0,"LATENT"],[47,2,0,28,0,"MODEL"],[49,34,0,24,4,"STRING"],[50,2,1,35,0,"CLIP"],[51,35,0,36,0,"CLIP"],[52,36,0,24,0,"CLIP"],[53,37,0,2,0,"MODEL"],[54,38,0,2,1,"CLIP"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.43192771084337345,"offset":[363.3333333333335,220.04741980474205]}},"version":0.4}